---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Every file-processing tool on Creek Mechanical runs entirely in your browser. Files are never uploaded to a server."
>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Your files never leave your browser.</strong> Every CAD viewer,
      converter, and analysis tool on this site processes your files
      entirely on your own device, using WebAssembly running locally in
      your browser tab. We never receive, store, or have access to any file
      you open, convert, or check with these tools — there is no upload
      step, because there is no server for a file to be uploaded to.
    </div>

    <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
    <p>
      This is a static site. At this stage we run no analytics, no
      tracking scripts, and no cookies. If that changes in the future,
      this page will be updated to say so plainly, before it happens.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can go to the address on the
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
